Another one of those pleasant surprises with 3.1..when there are two
or more shopkeepers visible on the screen, and you (p)ay, you are
put into a little menu to choose *which* shopkeeper you want to pay.
I encountered this in the mine town.  Of course, that feature might
always have been there, but I never got 2 shopkeepers together
in 3.0 :)

I'm trying to make a mega-mall with the level compiler.  I wonder
how many shops can be squeezed onto one level?

